278
00:14:33,780 --> 00:14:35,580
to interview him properly this afternoon,

279
00:14:35,580 --> 00:14:36,380
but...

280
00:14:43,180 --> 00:14:45,110
The interview fell through again.

281
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:46,900
Senior,

282
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:49,350
don't you think I'm super unlucky?

283
00:14:49,660 --> 00:14:52,460
I just took an elective course,
and this happened.

284
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:53,820
Sometimes, you don't have to

285
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:54,900
interview someone face-to-face

286
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:55,830
to get the story.

287
00:14:57,100 --> 00:14:58,760
Then who else can I interview?

288
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:01,120
You can find some objective facts

289
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:03,820
and talk to his classmates and friends.

290
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:06,620
That's what we call the indirect approach

291
00:15:06,620 --> 00:15:07,860
to interviewing.

292
00:15:08,180 --> 00:15:09,860
The indirect approach...

293
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:13,780
I think I get it.

294
00:15:14,460 --> 00:15:15,500
In short,

295
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:18,700
interviewing takes patience.

296
00:15:20,420 --> 00:15:23,020
I'm lending you my patience now.

297
00:15:23,780 --> 00:15:24,910
From this moment on,

298
00:15:24,950 --> 00:15:25,660
you're also someone

299
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:27,660
who can deal with problems
when they come up,

300
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:28,460
right?

301
00:15:28,580 --> 00:15:29,640
Thank you, Senior.

302
00:15:33,460 --> 00:15:34,590
Oh, and Xiangxiang.

303
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:36,980
If you need my help
with anything in the future,

304
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:37,910
just let me know.

305
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:39,300
Okay.

306
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:41,260
Bye.

307
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:51,660
Look at you.

308
00:15:52,020 --> 00:15:53,220
You sprayed him on the rooftop,

309
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:54,720
then you got him
taken to the police station

310
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,580
and nearly made him miss the game.

311
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:58,900
He probably
holds a grudge over all of that.

312
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:00,620
I guess you two are even now.

313
00:16:00,820 --> 00:16:03,880
Just think about how you'll work together
from here on.

314
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:06,100
But with the way Gu Han acted today,

315
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:07,300
who knows

316
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:09,230
what dirty tricks he'll pull next?

317
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:16,060
Isn't that Gu Han?

318
00:16:19,570 --> 00:16:22,150
[There Is No End to Learning]

319
00:16:19,660 --> 00:16:20,500
Gu Han,

320
00:16:20,780 --> 00:16:23,310
thank you
for supporting my interview class.

321
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:24,460
Mr. Jiang,

322
00:16:25,540 --> 00:16:27,230
I'm only willing to be interviewed by her.

323
00:16:27,230 --> 00:16:29,080
[Jiangcheng University]
[Name: Zhou Xiangxiang]

324
00:16:35,890 --> 00:16:37,130
[Gu Han]

325
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:41,590
I'm free right now. Come interview me.

326
00:16:42,220 --> 00:16:43,580
Is he even human?

327
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,370
Asking me to come out
for an interview this late?

328
00:16:45,370 --> 00:16:46,780
Xiangxiang, ignore him.

329
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:48,640
He's probably up to no good again.

330
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:50,180
As if I'd bother with him.

331
00:17:04,010 --> 00:17:07,700
[Gu Han]

332
00:17:11,780 --> 00:17:13,500
That was Gu Han just now, right?

333
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:15,150
Poor thing,
his face is covered in mosquito bites.

334
00:17:15,150 --> 00:17:16,300
Yeah.

335
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:19,099
Who do you think
he's been waiting for all this time?

336
00:17:19,099 --> 00:17:20,099
No idea.

337
00:17:25,060 --> 00:17:26,700
Sorry, Senior.

338
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:29,180
I just saw your message.
I'm already in bed.

339
00:17:29,220 --> 00:17:30,340
You should go back.

340
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:40,720
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

341
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:44,020
Our captain

342
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:45,500
really hates being interviewed.

343
00:17:45,500 --> 00:17:46,980
You've hit the jackpot.

344
00:17:47,340 --> 00:17:48,730
No one has ever managed to
get him to agree before.

345
00:17:48,730 --> 00:17:49,500
Actually,

346
00:17:49,620 --> 00:17:51,660
I don't necessarily have to
interview him in person.

347
00:17:51,660 --> 00:17:53,820
If you, his teammates,
have time for an interview,

348
00:17:53,820 --> 00:17:55,700
can provide enough material,

349
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,500
and are willing to talk a bit about him,

350
00:17:57,500 --> 00:17:59,100
I can write the piece from that.

351
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:00,700
But we have a game coming up,

352
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,430
so our training
has been pretty intense lately.

353
00:18:02,430 --> 00:18:04,260
Just give me 10 minutes of your time each.

354
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:05,500
As long as I get enough material,

355
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,340
I won't disturb your practice.

356
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:09,500
That shouldn't be a problem.

357
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:13,160
Let's make it quick, Zhou.

358
00:18:13,990 --> 00:18:14,440
[Voice Recorder]

359
00:18:14,620 --> 00:18:17,060
First, what's your impression of Gu Han?

360
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:19,260
He's extremely strict with himself.

361
00:18:19,260 --> 00:18:19,860
Of course,

362
00:18:19,980 --> 00:18:21,080
he's just as strict with us.

363
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:22,980
He even made me
a personalized training schedule.

364
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,410
But I'm still really grateful
to our captain.

365
00:18:24,410 --> 00:18:25,420
If it weren't for him,

366
00:18:25,420 --> 00:18:25,800
I wouldn't be

367
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:26,740
a starter now.

368
00:18:28,970 --> 00:18:31,150
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

369
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:38,780
Captain,

370
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:39,900
my stomach doesn't feel right.

371
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:41,360
I'm going to the bathroom.

372
00:18:42,460 --> 00:18:43,250
The captain

373
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:44,710
is usually cold on the outside
but warm on the inside.

374
00:18:44,710 --> 00:18:46,660
He gives us red envelopes during holidays.

375
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:47,820
[New; Campus Youth]

376
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:48,300
And he even grabs food for us
from the cafeteria sometimes.

377
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:50,020
He doesn't talk much,

378
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:51,340
but when it comes to the little details,

379
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:52,940
he's as thoughtful as a girl.

380
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:55,060
Whoever marries him

381
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:57,060
will be incredibly happy.

382
00:19:03,510 --> 00:19:05,680
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

383
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:06,910
Captain,

384
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:08,040
I want to go too.

385
00:19:12,940 --> 00:19:13,670
Xiangxiang.

386
00:19:14,580 --> 00:19:15,100
Senior, over here.

387
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:16,690
Xiangxiang, let's call it a day.

388
00:19:16,690 --> 00:19:18,100
He's about to
catch on to what we're up to.

389
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:18,620
It'll be really quick.

390
00:19:18,620 --> 00:19:19,490
You're the last one.

391
00:19:19,490 --> 00:19:21,220
Okay, I'll just tell you straight.

392
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:22,660
Gu Han is the heart of our team.

393
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:25,060
He's been training
since he was very young.

394
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:26,500
He's usually the last one to leave,

395
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:27,700
and he often stays behind
for extra training.

396
00:19:27,700 --> 00:19:30,500
Even when he's injured,
he pushes through and keeps going.

397
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:31,430
Just like today.

398
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:33,220
What happened to him today?

399
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:34,780
When he left home this morning,

400
00:19:34,780 --> 00:19:35,700
a little dog suddenly darted out

401
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:36,700
and startled him.

402
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:38,680
He fell and scraped his foot.

403
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,980
That unlucky?

404
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:42,900
Are there any other stories

405
00:19:42,900 --> 00:19:44,320
about him training with injuries?

406
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:45,320
Too many to count.

407
00:19:49,780 --> 00:19:50,380
That's all.

408
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:52,040
Let's leave it at that for now.

409
00:19:54,300 --> 00:19:55,380
He's coming. Let's go, hurry.

410
00:19:55,380 --> 00:19:55,910
Let's go.

411
00:19:58,590 --> 00:19:59,720
Men's room?

412
00:20:12,140 --> 00:20:13,510
[Pull]

413
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:18,380
Feet, feet, feet.

414
00:20:18,540 --> 00:20:20,380
Step on me. Hurry up.

415
00:20:20,230 --> 00:20:21,140
[Pull]

416
00:20:21,580 --> 00:20:22,900
Step on me.

417
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:42,790
He's leaving to wash his hands.

418
00:20:44,180 --> 00:20:45,580
Well? How's it going now?

419
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:06,100
Captain,

420
00:21:06,980 --> 00:21:08,290
i-it's my fault this time.

421
00:21:08,290 --> 00:21:09,620
Not training properly,

422
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:11,060
and still having time to goof off?

423
00:21:11,060 --> 00:21:11,500
No.

424
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:13,620
Then how did you find time
to be interviewed about me?

425
00:21:13,620 --> 00:21:15,420
My interview is my own business.

426
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:16,100
Everyone,

427
00:21:16,300 --> 00:21:18,820
no interviews
during training hours from now on.

428
00:21:18,820 --> 00:21:20,950
The interview is already done anyway.

429
00:21:28,300 --> 00:21:30,900
Good afternoon,
teachers and fellow students.

430
00:21:30,900 --> 00:21:33,460
Today, we'll be bringing you
a profile feature.

431
00:21:33,460 --> 00:21:34,260
The title is

432
00:21:34,300 --> 00:21:35,660
"Captain of the Jiangcheng University
Basketball Team:

433
00:21:35,660 --> 00:21:37,940
Against the Odds, Above the Noise."

434
00:21:36,580 --> 00:21:38,040
[Basketball player]

435
00:21:38,780 --> 00:21:40,040
Earlier this morning,

436
00:21:40,300 --> 00:21:43,420
the university's key basketball player,
Gu Han, suffered an unexpected injury.

437
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:45,460
As the heart of the basketball team,

438
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,670
[Content: "Captain of the JCU Basketball Team:
Against the Odds, Above the Noise"]

439
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:48,060
Gu Han knows
the responsibility he carries.

440
00:21:50,100 --> 00:21:51,060
Is his injury serious?

441
00:21:51,060 --> 00:21:51,920
Tell us quickly.

442
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:53,700
When he left home this morning,

443
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:55,020
a little dog suddenly darted out

444
00:21:55,020 --> 00:21:55,860
and startled him.

445
00:21:55,860 --> 00:21:56,500
He fell and scraped his foot.

446
00:21:56,500 --> 00:21:58,700
Does anyone know how Gu Han got injured?

447
00:22:05,170 --> 00:22:07,170
Is Gu Han really that afraid of dogs?

448
00:22:07,220 --> 00:22:08,890
He was so scared
that he actually hurt his foot.

449
00:22:08,890 --> 00:22:09,730
[I specifically confirmed this
with members of the basketball team.]

450
00:22:09,020 --> 00:22:10,220
Poor thing.

451
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:10,540
[When Gu Han left home this morning,]

452
00:22:10,570 --> 00:22:11,370
[he was startled by a neighbor's dog
that suddenly rushed out.]

453
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:12,250
[He bumped his foot on a rock.]

454
00:22:20,660 --> 00:22:21,600
He's really hurt.

455
00:22:21,600 --> 00:22:23,600
How long will it take him to recover?

456
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:25,260
Look.

457
00:22:25,700 --> 00:22:26,700
Can he still play?

458
00:22:28,270 --> 00:22:31,270
At this rate, he won't have recovered
before the game.

459
00:22:34,610 --> 00:22:35,900
How long until he gets better?

460
00:22:35,900 --> 00:22:38,380
You've officially become a Class I
protected animal on campus.

461
00:22:38,380 --> 00:22:39,790
Xiangxiang published an article,

462
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:40,880
[Ibuprofen Sustained-Release Capsules]

463
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:42,320
and the campus forum is buzzing about it.

464
00:22:42,660 --> 00:22:45,500
Your injury has now
turned into an inspirational blockbuster.

465
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:46,300
What injury?

466
00:22:52,460 --> 00:22:53,300
Did you

467
00:22:53,740 --> 00:22:55,380
tell Zhou Xiangxiang something?

468
00:22:55,380 --> 00:22:57,380
Kong Fang said you got scared by a dog

469
00:22:57,700 --> 00:22:59,360
and fell, scraping your foot.

470
00:23:02,900 --> 00:23:04,860
"This afternoon,
visiting our campus heartthrob at the gym.

471
00:23:04,860 --> 00:23:05,540
Who's coming

472
00:23:05,540 --> 00:23:06,260
with me?"

473
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:08,460
I originally wanted everyone to know

474
00:23:08,460 --> 00:23:10,900
the embarrassing story of Gu Han
being scared by a dog.

475
00:23:10,900 --> 00:23:13,980
Who knew everyone would end up
focusing on his injury instead?

476
00:23:13,980 --> 00:23:16,240
So many people are bringing Gu Han gifts.

477
00:23:16,660 --> 00:23:19,260
I bet he won't even have time
to accept them all.

478
00:23:22,900 --> 00:23:23,580
I'm off.

479
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,090
Where are you going?

480
00:23:25,420 --> 00:23:26,420
To watch the show.

481
00:23:29,470 --> 00:23:31,900
Oh my, there are so many.

482
00:23:32,100 --> 00:23:33,380
S-Senior Gu,

483
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:35,130
this is the pork trotter and bone broth
I made.

484
00:23:35,130 --> 00:23:35,980
I don't need it, thanks.

485
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:36,450
Senior...

486
00:23:36,450 --> 00:23:37,020
Excuse me,

487
00:23:37,020 --> 00:23:39,260
why don't you leave
the bone broth here for now?

488
00:23:39,260 --> 00:23:40,900
Our captain will drink it later.

489
00:23:40,900 --> 00:23:43,300
But the broth
won't taste good once it gets cold.

490
00:23:43,300 --> 00:23:44,660
Why don't you try some now?

491
00:23:44,660 --> 00:23:45,630
It works like a charm!

492
00:23:45,630 --> 00:23:46,580
-Thank you.
-Really.

493
00:23:46,580 --> 00:23:47,580
It works like a charm!

494
00:23:47,580 --> 00:23:48,140
I promise!

495
00:23:48,140 --> 00:23:48,570
I'll take it.

496
00:23:48,570 --> 00:23:49,970
Let's put it here for now.

497
00:23:55,530 --> 00:23:59,000
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

498
00:23:56,180 --> 00:23:56,860
Stop.

499
00:23:59,280 --> 00:24:00,260
Happy now?

500
00:24:01,060 --> 00:24:02,860
I can help clear things up for you.

501
00:24:02,860 --> 00:24:03,790
What do you want?

502
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:07,410
You have to cooperate with
my interviews from now on.

503
00:24:08,580 --> 00:24:10,060
Take your time thinking it over.

504
00:24:10,060 --> 00:24:12,060
I have plenty of time to wait for you.

505
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:21,300
When is Gu Han coming?

506
00:24:22,500 --> 00:24:23,700
What's going on here?

507
00:24:23,700 --> 00:24:25,100
I have no idea either.

508
00:24:25,120 --> 00:24:27,220
The basketball team's official account
invited us here.

509
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:28,880
Is it to thank us for the gifts?

510
00:24:29,940 --> 00:24:30,940
Just wait a moment.

511
00:24:30,940 --> 00:24:32,820
You'll know when Gu Han comes out.

512
00:24:33,860 --> 00:24:35,300
What's he up to this time?

513
00:24:35,300 --> 00:24:36,220
It's so late.

514
00:24:37,300 --> 00:24:38,300
Gu Han is here.

515
00:24:40,900 --> 00:24:41,700
Everyone,

516
00:24:42,300 --> 00:24:43,100
thank you

517
00:24:43,780 --> 00:24:46,020
for your concern
over the past couple of days.

518
00:24:46,020 --> 00:24:46,880
But from now on,

519
00:24:48,100 --> 00:24:50,360
you don't need to worry about me anymore.

520
00:24:50,740 --> 00:24:51,740
Why?

521
00:24:52,390 --> 00:24:53,860
Yeah, why?

522
00:24:53,980 --> 00:24:55,510
What are you chiming in for?

523
00:24:59,420 --> 00:25:00,220
Because...

524
00:25:01,460 --> 00:25:03,540
I already have someone to take care of me.

525
00:25:03,540 --> 00:25:06,470
-Take care of you?
-Who? Who?

526
00:25:06,860 --> 00:25:07,880
Tell us.

527
00:25:07,940 --> 00:25:08,860
Who?

528
00:25:23,180 --> 00:25:23,980
She...

529
00:25:25,060 --> 00:25:26,100
is my girlfriend.

530
00:25:26,700 --> 00:25:27,750
I'm not.

531
00:25:28,060 --> 00:25:29,460
Then why is he holding your hand?

532
00:25:29,460 --> 00:25:31,120
When did you two get together?

533
00:25:31,460 --> 00:25:32,340
Say something.

534
00:25:35,500 --> 00:25:36,660
Why is she running away?

535
00:25:36,660 --> 00:25:38,790
I've never heard anything about this.

536
00:25:46,340 --> 00:25:48,070
I really didn't expect that...

537
00:25:48,820 --> 00:25:50,620
he'd go this far.

538
00:25:52,260 --> 00:25:54,900
Don't worry. You and Gu Han don't really
have anything to do with each other.

539
00:25:54,900 --> 00:25:56,900
No one will gossip about it anymore.

540
00:25:57,780 --> 00:26:00,240
Right, the rumors
will die down on their own.

541
00:26:03,100 --> 00:26:03,900
Come on.

542
00:26:08,900 --> 00:26:10,230
Hello, Sister-in-law!

543
00:26:11,380 --> 00:26:12,580
Gu Han's girlfriend.

544
00:26:17,460 --> 00:26:19,260
Isn't that Gu Han's girlfriend?

545
00:26:19,340 --> 00:26:20,340
It really is her.

546
00:26:20,340 --> 00:26:20,860
It is.

547
00:26:25,140 --> 00:26:27,540
Xiangxiang? Why are you taking this class?

548
00:26:28,300 --> 00:26:30,500
After you mentioned it last time,

549
00:26:31,040 --> 00:26:32,700
I became interested in it too.

550
00:26:33,420 --> 00:26:34,140
Senior,

551
00:26:34,860 --> 00:26:35,700
can I sit here?

552
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:36,460
Go ahead.

553
00:26:53,790 --> 00:26:54,380
Look.

554
00:26:54,490 --> 00:26:55,530
Couples who've just gotten together

555
00:26:55,530 --> 00:26:56,460
really are different.

556
00:26:56,460 --> 00:26:57,700
She even follows him to class
just to show off their relationship.

557
00:26:57,700 --> 00:27:00,100
It's perfectly normal for a loving couple.

558
00:27:07,300 --> 00:27:08,230
Why are you here?

559
00:27:08,580 --> 00:27:09,420
This is a course in my major.

560
00:27:09,420 --> 00:27:11,300
Why is he everywhere?

561
00:27:11,380 --> 00:27:13,580
Zhou Xiangxiang, you're so unlucky.

562
00:27:13,660 --> 00:27:14,460
Class,

563
00:27:14,820 --> 00:27:16,380
this semester, our marketing course

564
00:27:16,380 --> 00:27:18,500
will focus primarily on market research.

565
00:27:18,500 --> 00:27:19,300
You'll be

566
00:27:19,380 --> 00:27:22,860
working in groups
to complete a practical research project.

567
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,360
Four people per group.

568
00:27:24,390 --> 00:27:25,420
For example,

569
00:27:25,420 --> 00:27:26,660
you four could form a group.

570
00:27:26,660 --> 00:27:28,500
The rest of you
can find your own groupmates.

571
00:27:28,500 --> 00:27:29,510
After that,

572
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:32,100
we'll draw lots and discuss, okay?

573
00:27:33,300 --> 00:27:34,880
Then it's settled.
The four of us are a group.

574
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:35,460
Okay.

575
00:27:36,620 --> 00:27:37,580
Have you decided who to team up with?

576
00:27:37,580 --> 00:27:38,380
With them.

577
00:27:40,500 --> 00:27:43,300
The four of us can just form a group.

578
00:27:43,500 --> 00:27:44,300
Alright.

579
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:46,150
Come on.

580
00:27:46,170 --> 00:27:47,230
Let's form a group.

581
00:27:49,620 --> 00:27:51,060
Alright, how's it going?

582
00:27:51,060 --> 00:27:52,260
Have you all gotten into groups yet?

583
00:27:52,260 --> 00:27:53,360
-Yeah.
-Yes.

584
00:27:53,390 --> 00:27:55,050
Everyone's in a group, right?

585
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:57,160
Sir, I don't have a group yet.

586
00:28:00,300 --> 00:28:02,420
Then, you four can form a group.

587
00:28:02,500 --> 00:28:03,300
No!

588
00:28:03,820 --> 00:28:04,620
Why?

589
00:28:08,300 --> 00:28:09,630
I want to switch groups.

590
00:28:09,900 --> 00:28:12,160
You're from another department, right?

591
00:28:12,660 --> 00:28:15,060
Gu Han's grades are excellent.

592
00:28:15,060 --> 00:28:15,860
If you're in his group,

593
00:28:15,860 --> 00:28:17,300
he can help guide you.

594
00:28:17,900 --> 00:28:19,300
Gu Han, what do you think?

595
00:28:19,860 --> 00:28:21,260
I have no problem with it.

596
00:28:25,500 --> 00:28:26,300
You?

597
00:28:31,300 --> 00:28:32,100
That's more like it.

598
00:28:32,100 --> 00:28:32,780
Alright.

599
00:28:33,290 --> 00:28:34,820
Now we've finished forming the groups.

600
00:28:34,820 --> 00:28:35,770
After class,

601
00:28:36,220 --> 00:28:39,500
we'll draw lots to determine
your market research locations.

602
00:28:39,500 --> 00:28:40,830
I want to drop the class.

603
00:28:43,710 --> 00:28:44,850
[My Courses]

604
00:28:47,340 --> 00:28:49,110
[Unable to Drop Course]
[Sorry, the course drop deadline has passed]

605
00:28:47,820 --> 00:28:50,020
Oh no, it's too late to drop it now.

606
00:29:00,620 --> 00:29:01,900
Go to the supermarket and buy some snacks.

607
00:29:01,900 --> 00:29:02,700
Two hundred yuan's worth.

608
00:29:02,700 --> 00:29:04,580
Make sure they're all different kinds.

609
00:29:04,580 --> 00:29:05,300
I'm not going.

610
00:29:05,300 --> 00:29:06,700
Go yourself if you want to.

611
00:29:06,700 --> 00:29:07,980
If you refuse to cooperate with
your group leader,

612
00:29:07,980 --> 00:29:09,240
you can switch groups.

613
00:29:14,290 --> 00:29:15,550
I don't have the money!

614
00:29:18,360 --> 00:29:19,490
[Gu Han]

615
00:29:22,500 --> 00:29:24,380
Did you strike it rich?
You got a ton of snacks!

616
00:29:24,380 --> 00:29:25,140
Here.

617
00:29:26,760 --> 00:29:27,460
Xiangxiang,

618
00:29:27,460 --> 00:29:29,500
why did you decide to
take a course in management?

619
00:29:29,500 --> 00:29:31,060
This is one of the hardest courses
to pass.

620
00:29:31,060 --> 00:29:33,990
In previous years,
the pass rate was only 80% at best.

621
00:29:37,180 --> 00:29:37,860
It's okay.

622
00:29:38,100 --> 00:29:39,180
Gu Han will help carry you.

623
00:29:39,180 --> 00:29:40,240
You should be fine.

624
00:29:46,180 --> 00:29:46,980
Do this.

625
00:29:48,460 --> 00:29:49,420
What is this?

626
00:29:48,900 --> 00:29:49,930
[Jiangcheng University
Principles of Marketing Exam—Paper A]

627
00:29:49,500 --> 00:29:50,180
A quiz.

628
00:29:50,450 --> 00:29:53,900
I want to see where my groupmate
from another department stands.

629
00:29:53,900 --> 00:29:55,460
You're taking this too far!

630
00:29:56,290 --> 00:29:57,890
You can either change groups

631
00:29:57,900 --> 00:29:58,830
or drop the class.

632
00:29:58,700 --> 00:29:59,610
[Jiangcheng University
Principles of Marketing Exam—Paper A]

633
00:30:37,820 --> 00:30:38,660
Take a look.

634
00:30:47,660 --> 00:30:48,660
How did I do?

635
00:30:54,700 --> 00:30:55,500
Terrible.

636
00:30:57,060 --> 00:30:57,990
[The Essence of Marketing]

637
00:30:57,660 --> 00:30:59,580
These 2 books will be used in this class.

638
00:30:59,580 --> 00:31:00,580
Go back and read them.

639
00:31:00,580 --> 00:31:02,240
Don't hold the rest of us back.

640
00:31:02,700 --> 00:31:04,420
You look down on me?

641
00:31:05,300 --> 00:31:06,100
I'm off.

642
00:31:07,140 --> 00:31:07,900
Bye.

643
00:31:13,260 --> 00:31:13,980
Xiangxiang,

644
00:31:13,980 --> 00:31:16,040
did you rob the library or something?

645
00:31:20,100 --> 00:31:21,300
That economics teacher of mine

646
00:31:21,300 --> 00:31:22,960
is brutal about the pass rate.

647
00:31:24,900 --> 00:31:26,020
With my grades,

648
00:31:26,020 --> 00:31:27,660
I'd be toast.

649
00:31:28,660 --> 00:31:29,780
At least you know

650
00:31:29,780 --> 00:31:31,020
where you stand.

651
00:31:32,260 --> 00:31:34,580
Why did you choose this course
in the first place?

652
00:31:34,580 --> 00:31:35,860
Senior Fang Yu.

653
00:31:35,900 --> 00:31:38,700
Isn't this a good chance
for you to ask him for help?

654
00:31:38,980 --> 00:31:39,930
Yeah.

655
00:31:40,110 --> 00:31:42,390
[Library]

656
00:32:04,380 --> 00:32:05,180
Found it?

657
00:32:08,900 --> 00:32:10,060
Senior Fang Yu.

658
00:32:10,500 --> 00:32:12,100
Is this the right book?

659
00:32:14,780 --> 00:32:16,180
Actually, I was just about to

660
00:32:16,180 --> 00:32:18,180
recommend this book when you asked.

661
00:32:27,100 --> 00:32:28,060
Sorry, sorry.

662
00:32:53,180 --> 00:32:54,800
If the stinger isn't removed
and the area isn't properly

663
00:32:54,800 --> 00:32:55,980
disinfected as soon as possible,

664
00:32:55,980 --> 00:32:57,660
the swelling could spread rapidly.

665
00:32:57,660 --> 00:32:58,660
In severe cases,

666
00:32:58,660 --> 00:33:00,460
it could lead to acute kidney failure,

667
00:33:00,460 --> 00:33:01,700
anaphylactic shock,

668
00:33:01,860 --> 00:33:03,520
and other serious reactions.

669
00:33:03,820 --> 00:33:04,460
Sit down.

670
00:33:05,060 --> 00:33:05,540
Doctor,

671
00:33:05,540 --> 00:33:06,940
we'll be counting on you.

672
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:16,860
Sorry.

673
00:33:16,860 --> 00:33:17,920
Try to bear with it.

674
00:33:23,900 --> 00:33:24,700
I'm sorry.

675
00:33:24,700 --> 00:33:25,900
Just a little longer.

676
00:33:29,900 --> 00:33:31,460
Doctor, can you stop messing around?

677
00:33:31,460 --> 00:33:32,580
It really hurts!

678
00:33:32,670 --> 00:33:34,390
Then why did you mess with the bees
in the first place?

679
00:33:34,390 --> 00:33:35,260
Bear with it.

680
00:33:37,020 --> 00:33:37,980
Gu Han, it's all your fault!

681
00:33:37,980 --> 00:33:39,340
I hate you!

682
00:33:45,070 --> 00:33:48,070
[Jiangcheng University
Health Center Management Policy]

683
00:33:45,460 --> 00:33:47,260
Just because of
the misunderstanding last time,

684
00:33:47,260 --> 00:33:48,780
you tricked me into eating mustard.

685
00:33:48,780 --> 00:33:50,420
Then you tricked me into
getting stung by bees!

686
00:33:50,420 --> 00:33:53,550
And now you've found
some half-baked doctor to treat me!

687
00:34:05,020 --> 00:34:05,820
First of all,

688
00:34:06,580 --> 00:34:07,900
I'm a medical intern.

689
00:34:07,900 --> 00:34:10,699
Strictly speaking, I'm half a doctor.

690
00:34:11,460 --> 00:34:12,260
And,

691
00:34:12,500 --> 00:34:13,159
here's your medicine.

692
00:34:13,159 --> 00:34:14,489
Don't forget to take it.

693
00:34:14,730 --> 00:34:15,500
Um... Don't forget to spray it on.
